# INV-15 — invented. A declaration match, one innings a side, ten overs allowed: Home declare, the chase falls one short.
# Edge cases: a declared innings (7.0 overs, three down, seven overs of the ten
# unused: "declared", never sealed as overs or all out); a declaration match
# gives NO free hit, so a front-foot no-ball is followed by a bowled that
# stands, three times (the opener bowled in the 1st over of each innings and
# B4's lbw, both on the ball after a no-ball) — the same marks in a limited-
# overs match would save the batter; the chase's target one more than the
# declared total (75), a chase that ends on its overs one run short: won by
# one run, and a stumping with no keeper on record.
# (A draw is not expressible here: the pad's innings break sets the chase's
# target as one innings a side, and a drawn match needs two innings a side.)
match INV-15
title A declaration, and a chase one run short
date 2026-11-15
overs 10
sides Home Away
conditions declaration

innings 1 Home
open B1 B2
over BW1  1 . 4 nb W:b 1 2
over BW2  . 1 4 1 . 6
over BW3  2 1 1 W:c/F5 . 4
over BW4  1 . 1 4 2 1
over BW1  . 4 1 1 6 .
over BW2  1 1 nb W:lbw 2 4 1
over BW3  4 . 1 6 1 2
declare

innings 2 Away
open B1 B2
over BW1  . 1 4 nb W:b 2 1
over BW2  1 . W:c/F7 4 1 1
over BW3  2 6 . 1 nb 1 W:lbw
over BW4  1 1 . 4 2 .
over BW1  . 1 W:st/F1 . 1 4
over BW2  1 2 . 6 1 .
over BW3  . 1 1 4 . 1
over BW4  2 . 1 W:b 1 1
over BW1  1 4 . 1 1 .
over BW2  1 . 1 W:c/F3 1 .

# ── The card, worked by hand ──
# Home, over by over: 9, 13, 8, 9, 12, 9, 14 = 74 (two of them no-ball runs).
card 1
bat B1 11 7 1 0 c F5 b BW3
bat B2 4 4 1 0 b BW1
bat B3 36 18 2 3 not out
bat B4 7 8 1 0 lbw b BW2
bat B5 14 7 2 0 not out
extras b 0 lb 0 w 0 nb 2 p 0
total 74/3 7.0
fow 1-6 B2 0.4
fow 2-25 B1 2.4
fow 3-53 B4 5.3
bowl BW1 2-0-21-1 wd 0 nb 1
bowl BW2 2-0-22-1 wd 0 nb 1
bowl BW3 2-0-22-1 wd 0 nb 0
bowl BW4 1-0-9-0 wd 0 nb 0

# Away, needing 75, over by over: 9, 7, 11, 8, 6, 10, 7, 5, 7, 3 = 73.
card 2
bat B1 1 4 0 0 c F7 b BW2
bat B2 4 3 1 0 b BW1
bat B3 14 9 0 1 lbw b BW3
bat B4 13 10 2 0 st F1 b BW1
bat B5 28 21 2 1 c F3 b BW2
bat B6 3 6 0 0 b BW4
bat B7 7 8 1 0 not out
bat B8 1 1 0 0 not out
extras b 0 lb 0 w 0 nb 2 p 0
total 73/6 10.0
fow 1-6 B2 0.4
fow 2-10 B1 1.3
fow 3-27 B3 2.6
fow 4-36 B4 4.3
fow 5-61 B6 7.4
fow 6-72 B5 9.4
bowl BW1 3-0-22-2 wd 0 nb 1
bowl BW2 3-0-20-2 wd 0 nb 0
bowl BW3 2-0-18-1 wd 0 nb 1
bowl BW4 2-0-13-1 wd 0 nb 0

result Home won by 1 run
